      "body": "Closes #7949. Task 14309 (lane code-u).\n\n- pkarr-worker: add pkgs/pkarr-worker/test/deploy-probe.test.ts and deploy-verification.test.ts (entry now lists all 4 test files); replace the stale clean-checkout lockfile/runner-breakage reason with the verified state (2026-11-08 probe at aa01b61853: npm ci succeeds, npm test = 4 files / 61 tests passed); remaining gap is venue wiring (#6093). Venue and status unchanged.\n- cold-store-reaper.worker: add pkgs/cold-store-reaper/worker/test/bounded-decompress.test.mjs (the #6590 zstd expansion-bound regression suite, already wired into that package npm test and passing standalone).\n- Registry audit metadata and uncovered_count (46) unchanged.\n\nValidation: registry JSON parses (python json.load); every listed path for both entries exists in the tree.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796807432&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8015&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8015&signature=faf51f0523d113474fa374e460287f3e51f2725e4048bcef305cd6af430790be\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8015?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
